---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Research and Development | AC-130 Viper" description="Learn about ongoing AC-130 Viper engineering, testing and regulatory-development activities.">
  <main>
    <section class="sub-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">02 / RESEARCH & DEVELOPMENT</p>
        <h1>Development in progress.</h1>
        <p>An overview of the work supporting the ongoing development program.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section"><div class="container split-layout"><div><h2>Engineering, testing and documentation</h2><p>New York Cryogen continues work on the AC-130 Viper localized CO₂ cooling platform. Activities described on the existing site include engineering refinement, testing, quality preparation and work relevant to regulatory review.</p><p>Final product configuration, intended use, labeling and timing of any potential availability may change.</p></div><figure class="content-image"><img src="/images/viper-device.png" alt="AC-130 Viper product development system" width="1000" height="562" loading="lazy" /></figure></div></section>
    <section class="content-section light-section"><div class="container"><h2>Current public information</h2><div class="info-grid"><article class="info-card"><h3>Product</h3><p>Localized CO₂ cooling technology under development.</p></article><article class="info-card"><h3>United States availability</h3><p>Not available for commercial distribution.</p></article><article class="info-card"><h3>Regulatory process</h3><p>Any current FDA submission status must be independently verified with the company before publishing a specific claim.</p></article></div><p class="editorial-note">Research references on the original website require scientific and regulatory review before findings are presented as evidence about AC-130 Viper safety or effectiveness.</p></div></section>

    <section class="sub-cta">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">STAY CONNECTED</p>
        <h2>Follow the development of AC-130 Viper.</h2>
        <p>For product-development, company, business or media inquiries, contact New York Cryogen.</p>
        <a class="button-primary" href="/contact/">Contact New York Cryogen ↗</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
